# What is left out of the upload when the web app is deployed with the Vercel CLI.
# The CLI does not read .gitignore, and its own list does not skip .env, so everything that is
# not needed to build the web app is named here. The planner in fastapi-backend/ is its own
# Vercel project with its own .vercelignore.
#
# Folder names start with a slash on purpose: without it a name matches at every depth, and
# "supabase/" would also drop src/integrations/supabase/, which the app needs.
/fastapi-backend/
/ollama/
/tests/
/scripts/
/supabase/
/dist/
/.run/
/.tanstack/
/.local-test-user.json
/.local-test-user*.json
*.db
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
/AUDIT_*.md
